type 97 13 18
type 97 2 3
type 97 97
type 97 16 18
type 97 40 18
type 40 97 51 46
press 100
type 18 30 16 40 41 7
release 100
press 100
type 40
release 100
type 30
mods 0 0 0 0
sweep
mods 1 0 0 0
sweep
mods 128 0 0 0
sweep
mods 129 0 0 0
sweep
mods 0 0 2 0
sweep
